        <mxCell id="c32" value="at once; only if the text changed; once" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cfcfcf;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="830" y="416" width="436" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c33" value='not rewritten: removed at the end, unless &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;delete-if-not-rewrited&lt;/font&gt; is&lt;br&gt;false' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cfcfcf;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="416" width="436" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c34" value='&lt;b&gt;once&lt;/b&gt;: writing the same path twice in one run is an error · &lt;b&gt;roots may not be nested&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;add_place&lt;/font&gt;) · &lt;b&gt;"at the end"&lt;/b&gt; runs in &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;do_jobs_at_end&lt;/font&gt;, only after a run that succeeded · the log folder is opened by Logme and is not a place&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;routing&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;process_result&lt;/font&gt;): the principal XML → intermediate; &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;cpp2gal&lt;/font&gt; output → the output .gal place; &lt;font face="Consolas"&gt;@@alias@@relative@@&lt;/font&gt; → the store with that alias; a relative path → intermediate; an absolute path → written directly' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbfbfb;strokeColor=#cccccc;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="506" width="2120" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
